# kicad-cli writes SVG style attributes split across lines, leaving trailing
# whitespace on hundreds of them. These files are generated by
# `kicad-cli sch export svg`, never hand-edited, so the whitespace carries no
# meaning and cannot be cleaned up without diverging from the generator's output.
# Excluding them keeps the `git diff --check` that AGENTS.md requires useful:
# without this it fails on every schematic re-export and stops flagging the
# hand-written code it is actually meant to catch.
*.svg -whitespace
